    "items": [
      {
        "id": "book001-b000541-p000-ebe3164d76",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "位置显明。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000542-p000-14a4d4eb6a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "廉贞星独属火，其形如石峰堆叠，山岩险峻且无土壤，若非有间隔之处便不可在此安葬。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000543-p000-e0e023eb1f",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "廉贞星势锐利挺直如同飞仙，罗悬峰上僧人端坐禅定。自然形成的烟焰参差起伏，红旗展开转动，由此得名流传。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000544-p000-31ca507e2e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "廉贞星若有水经过并落入平田，其形如死蛇挂在树上或牛轭相连。或者像反旗斜脚转动，又如惊蛇出草并像蚰蜒蜿蜒。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000545-p000-b36df4220a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "多化作蛟潭和鬼窟，若遇到有间隔的龙脉方可安葬。如同游侠般智谋过人被人荐拔，开国成家富贵绵延。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000546-p000-266d8e81a2",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "廉贞星若有间隔且武练真宝，如电掣雷轰风扫袅袅。贵人幕下绣墩圆润，风铃檐马珂珰小巧。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000547-p000-f216b49bda",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "尖圆相继向前行进，若不遇到有间隔的龙脉终究会犯燥。旗下将军台伏奸邪，开国成家自然由天召。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000548-p000-17e45ea474",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "廉贞星若有间隔且武，百炼锋刃坚利，顺制若无间隔，名缰利锁缠绕。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000549-p000-0b55a4e31f",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "廉贞星若有间隔且贪狼形异常，如照天蜡烛气势高昂。旗下剑旌逞显威武，乱枪插地烛照穹苍。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000550-p000-108f376a0e",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "红旗旌节拥簇前后，宝殿龙楼拥簇外阳。形势相生垣局完备，仁慈忠义觐见天堂。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000551-p000-b7c20c9dd7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "廉贞星若有间隔且巨门星立层台，富贵双全且具文武才。未遇真人应当秘固，福龙须待福人来。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000552-p000-bb21389646",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "贪狼星直耸如人坐，紫气平头身偃卧。身根稍穴具三停，胸堂手足求真佐。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000553-p000-06a5049c3a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "胸粗倚乳避元辰，反掌股肱插肩窝。人形相似觅其中，虎口钳开身侧卧。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000554-p000-0b65f83298",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "贪狼星若有水经过，其形难捉，左右纵横形杂错。或似贵人引凤凰，或似猛将旌旗卓。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000555-p000-c3dad0f4e2",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "海翁忘机玩鸥鸟，寿星兀坐观龟鹤。倒地木星平地水，水星飘曳木端雅。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000556-p000-924627e6ef",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "二星富贵隔云泥，玉石不分空度臆。贪狼星遇曲飞峰走，仙童旌节生福寿。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000557-p000-444915c986",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "贪狼星遇武多不宜，形势乖张气甚殊。鬼劫纵横形驳杂，蛟潭鬼窟神坛依。九变十二炁充盛，神雷挺火立车欹。神祠洞府获吉鬼，火生傍土谏可持。殷人游侠富韬略，结体肥圆格喜奇。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000558-p000-7fe431dd98",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "贪狼星遇武，炼饶釜覆，水火炼龙，免遭刑戮。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000559-p000-6322837dea",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "贪狼星遇廉贞多奇峰，认取子孙符祖宗。递相传变五星足，富贵双全禄位隆。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000560-p000-89c883807b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "三八木也。旺东龙祖盛，南北相生换宗嫡。三变西方始养就，天市钟形仍向东。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      }
